Z||000000||sully5||05-21-2000||12:23 AM||||Heres the deal - tonight I am taking a buddy of mine for a ride. Pull out of his neighborhood and get on it. The car hesitates, makes a loud "POP" sound, and goes dead. Replaced the module and it fired up. My question is, what would cause it to hesitate like that? Runs great otherwise. Appreciate any help. BTW - its an 86 2.8l.||||reg||1
