Z||000004||mshill||05-21-2000||11:43 AM||||sully5,  I had the exact same experience when I first purchased my 86SE V6.  In my case I think the pickup coil somehow got slightly rotated in the distributor, and this caused the the wrong timing in the module (causing the backfire) and killing it.  I had to replace both items.<P>||||reg||1
